              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LUVGIGGLIN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is great...very easy to make and everyone raves! I changed it slightly by substituting 1/2 of the sour cream with 2/3 a stick of cream cheese. I found that this keeps the dip from getting too soggy with the sour cream. Also, I occasionally add chopped lettuce, tomatoes, and onions before the cheese layer. Thanks for sharing!!"
          },
