            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "donna"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this recipe...I omit the guacamole and add cooked chicken or ground beef to make a whole meal. I also like lettuce and green onions chopped and sprinkled on top. I make individual plates of this and serve it with chips or warm tortillas.",
            "datePublished": "2000-09-28T10:18:53.503Z"
          },
          {
