            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I served this recipe at a party and everyone loved it! It's very spicy because of the taco seasoning which makes it stand out compared to other mexican dips. Instead of jalepeno peppers I chose to use green peppers. -Sheila",
            "datePublished": "2001-11-15T15:21:36.390Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
