            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Malphaba"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm definitely keeping this recipe around to make again! I wanted a quick and easy layered dip that involved guacamole and this was perfect. No baking, no meat, and after serving it at my New Year's party there was absolutely none left! The only thing I changed was using black olives instead of jalapenos, but still had great flavor! Love this!",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-01T17:22:11.020Z"
          },
          {
