              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "greta"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a party and it got rave reviews from everyone! I scarfed half of it myself:)Delicious! I made it just like the recipe and added some green onions to the top for color and a little extra flavor. Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2010-05-13T12:23:15.923Z"
