              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bonnie Franklin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "soooo good. i make my own guacaole because i love extra lime juice! i use the canned diced tomatoes w/ chilies &amp; top it all with chilies or green onion &amp; some sliced back olives.",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-07T11:52:54.957Z"
