            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sheri Hypes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good recipe. I did make some adjustments. To me, refried beans are very bland. So I stirred in a small can of chopped jalepeno peppers into the beans before spreading them into the pan. I topped the sour cream mixture with cheese and that was it, I didn't add the other toppings. Very yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-02T13:12:54.757Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made my own bean dip and guacamole (avocados were on sale), and used a taco seasoning from this site which I always have mixed up and in the pantry. This turned out to be a very budget-friendly appetizer. I didn’t have any cheddar on hand, but my husband said he really didn’t think it needed it. What a great idea to mix the taco seasoning into the sour cream; won’t forget that for other recipes. I served this dip on small individual plates with blue tortilla chips, and everybody enjoyed it. Very nice recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2023-03-11T15:59:47.986Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sheila LaLonde"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved using the bean dip instead of refried beans. I did make my own guacamole just because I think it's way better. I also made my own taco seasoning because I was out of prepackaged. I honestly have to say that this was one of the best layered Mexican dips I have ever made, but only with my change of using homemade guacamole.",
            "datePublished": "2023-03-17T03:17:58.472Z"
          },
          {
