            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BASSETLUV"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this for several years for our super bowl party. It is always a big hit, never any leftovers! The only change I make is I also sprinkle some sliced black olives and sliced green onions over the top. Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2016-02-03T16:59:34.153Z"
